Add `@Sampled` to standalone zero-argument `@Composable` samples that omitted it upstream, so
`scripts/samples-previews.mjs`, `scripts/android-samples.mjs`, and `scripts/samples-spec.mjs`
discover and publish them with `@Preview` wrappers, along with background, interactivity, and
size fixes for those newly exposed samples.

